{"content_hash": "dd4e71f372b66534", "version_id": 862, "article_id": 87, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Card maker Hitcard may buy control of solar glass firm Yamaton", "title_zh": "卡牌公司Hitcard或收购光伏玻璃企业亚玛顿控股权", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8192045.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589759829060-eb3e3a77cdee?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8aGl0Y2FyZHxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzNzU2MTA1fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Fearghal Kelly on Unsplash", "author": "Fearghal Kelly", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@fgal?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-5OgIsvOO1Rk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(21, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(59, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f08d1f69b25e"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-04", "word_count": 132, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "A Chinese card brand wants to take control of a listed solar glass company. This may be a faster way to reach the stock market.", "lead_zh": "一家中国卡牌品牌想控股一家上市光伏玻璃公司，这可能是它更快上市的一条路。", "preview": "On November 2, Yamaton said its biggest shareholder will sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network. Qixing runs Hitcard, a brand of ", "preview_zh": "11月2日，亚玛顿表示其最大股东将把20%的股份出售给上海骑形网络。骑形运营着成人收藏卡品牌Hitcard。交易价格尚未确定，公司股票自11月3日起停牌。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 845, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 47.4, "size_bytes": 285408, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 153, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 48.575, "size_bytes": 292464, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 153, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 51.65, "size_bytes": 310896, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 153, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 44.95, "size_bytes": 270720, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 153, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 48.45, "size_bytes": 291600, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 153, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0cb59f2/content/data/versions/862.json", "paragraphs": ["On November 2, Yamaton said its biggest shareholder will sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network. Qixing runs Hitcard, a brand of collectible cards for adults. The price is not set yet, and trading in the stock stopped on November 3.", "Hitcard has wanted to list its shares for some time. Other card companies, like Kayou and Suplay, have also waited a long time. The deal asks Yamaton to be able to buy other assets later. Many people see this as a backdoor listing.", "Yamaton makes glass for solar panels. The solar industry is in trouble, and the company lost money in 2024 and 2025. The Lin family, which controls the company, tried twice to buy a supplier but failed both times. Now they will keep 14.9% of the shares."], "paragraphs_zh": ["11月2日，亚玛顿表示其最大股东将把20%的股份出售给上海骑形网络。骑形运营着成人收藏卡品牌Hitcard。交易价格尚未确定，公司股票自11月3日起停牌。", "Hitcard想上市已经有一段时间了。卡游、Suplay等其他卡牌公司也等了很久。这笔交易要求亚玛顿以后能够收购其他资产。很多人认为这是一种借壳上市。", "亚玛顿生产太阳能电池板用的玻璃。光伏行业正陷入困境，公司在2024年和2025年都出现亏损。控股的林氏家族曾两次尝试收购一家供应商，但都失败了。如今他们将保留14.9%的股份。"], "body": "On November 2, Yamaton said its biggest shareholder will sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network. Qixing runs Hitcard, a brand of collectible cards for adults. The price is not set yet, and trading in the stock stopped on November 3.\n\nHitcard has wanted to list its shares for some time. Other card companies, like Kayou and Suplay, have also waited a long time. The deal asks Yamaton to be able to buy other assets later. Many people see this as a backdoor listing.\n\nYamaton makes glass for solar panels. The solar industry is in trouble, and the company lost money in 2024 and 2025. The Lin family, which controls the company, tried twice to buy a supplier but failed both times. Now they will keep 14.9% of the shares.", "body_zh": "11月2日，亚玛顿表示其最大股东将把20%的股份出售给上海骑形网络。骑形运营着成人收藏卡品牌Hitcard。交易价格尚未确定，公司股票自11月3日起停牌。\n\nHitcard想上市已经有一段时间了。卡游、Suplay等其他卡牌公司也等了很久。这笔交易要求亚玛顿以后能够收购其他资产。很多人认为这是一种借壳上市。\n\n亚玛顿生产太阳能电池板用的玻璃。光伏行业正陷入困境，公司在2024年和2025年都出现亏损。控股的林氏家族曾两次尝试收购一家供应商，但都失败了。如今他们将保留14.9%的股份。", "text": "On November 2, Yamaton said its biggest shareholder will sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network. Qixing runs Hitcard, a brand of collectible cards for adults. The price is not set yet, and trading in the stock stopped on November 3. Hitcard has wanted to list its shares for some time. Other card companies, like Kayou and Suplay, have also waited a long time. The deal asks Yamaton to be able to buy other assets later. Many people see this as a backdoor listing. Yamaton makes glass for solar panels. The solar industry is in trouble, and the company lost money in 2024 and 2025. The Lin family, which controls the company, tried twice to buy a supplier but failed both times. Now they will keep 14.9% of the shares.", "vocab": [{"word": "shareholder", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股东", "note": "公司股份的持有者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "常与 sell、buy 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "collectible", "pos": "adj", "zh": "收藏的", "note": "collectible cards 收藏卡", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "list", "pos": "verb", "zh": "上市", "note": "指公司股票公开交易", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "asset", "pos": "noun", "zh": "资产", "note": "公司拥有的有价值的东西", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "backdoor listing", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "借壳上市", "note": "通过收购上市公司实现上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "industry", "pos": "noun", "zh": "行业", "note": "如 solar industry 光伏行业", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lose money", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "亏损", "note": "过去式 lost money", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-04T01:35:03.845173", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.225, "e": 0.338, "sm": 225, "em": 337, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "November", "s": 0.338, "e": 0.738, "sm": 337, "em": 737, "cs": 3, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "2", "s": 0.738, "e": 1.15, "sm": 737, "em": 1149, "cs": 12, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.262, "sm": 1150, "em": 1262, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Yamaton", "s": 1.262, "e": 1.75, "sm": 1262, "em": 1750, "cs": 15, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "said", "s": 1.75, "e": 1.913, "sm": 1750, "em": 1912, "cs": 23, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "its", "s": 1.913, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1912, "em": 2075, "cs": 28, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "biggest", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.375, "sm": 2075, "em": 2374, "cs": 32, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "shareholder", "s": 2.375, "e": 2.95, "sm": 2375, "em": 2950, "cs": 40, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "will", "s": 2.95, "e": 3.1, "sm": 2950, "em": 3099, "cs": 52, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "sell", "s": 3.1, "e": 3.362, "sm": 3100, "em": 3362, "cs": 57, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "2